OL,5,G0900 Secrets of the Royal Traditions
OL,6,     FWe explore the surprising origins
OL,7,     Fof the New Year's and Birthday
OL,8,     FHonours, how royals contribute -
OL,9,     Fand recover - from scandals, and
OL,10,     Fthe defunct role of the royal
OL,11,     Fjester.
OL,12,G1000 Secrets of the Royal Traditions
OL,13,     FWe delve into a turbulent history
OL,14,     Fto ask why every monarch is
OL,15,     Fexpected to produce at least two
OL,16,     Foffspring - preferably male. Plus,
OL,17,     Fthe curious custom of royal
OL,18,     Fwarrants.
